{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "f418b526-87c6-8030-92db-30d63acc8dcc",
  "created_at": "2025-12-26T12:23:26-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Diogo Furtado",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T12:19:07-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T12:19:12-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, hi. I'm calling about a catch basin. It's clogged up with leaves and the water just sits there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T12:19:21-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I can take that down. Where is the catch basin?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T12:19:26-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's on the corner by my mother's house. 396 Admiral Kalbfus Road. In the North End."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T12:19:33-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "396 Admiral Kalbfus Road, North End. And you said it's on the corner, so is it right in front of 396 or at the corner nearby?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T12:19:45-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The corner right there, next to her house. Maybe thirty feet down. I'm calling for her, she doesn't really do the phone."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T12:19:55-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine. Can I get your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T12:19:59-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Diogo Furtado."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T12:20:01-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Diogo Furtado. Okay, and how long has it been blocked up?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T12:20:06-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Since before the holidays. Leaves packed in the grate, early December at least. And it hasn't rained, that's the thing. It's dry out. The puddle just never goes away."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T12:20:19-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So no storm, just standing water that isn't draining."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T12:20:24-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right. It's been the same puddle for weeks. And now cars are slowing down to a crawl going through it. Nobody wants to splash the sidewalk or get stuck in the middle of it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T12:20:39-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, that makes sense. Let me look at the notes here. [pause] One moment."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T12:20:46-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, take your time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T12:20:49-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I'm seeing the basins in that area are on a list, but I'm not seeing a recent entry for that exact corner."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T12:20:59-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So when did they last come by? That's what I want to know. Because I've seen nobody."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T12:21:07-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I don't have a date for that corner in front of me. I can have the crew supervisor check the records and see when it was last cleaned. Would you want a call back on that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T12:21:23-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah. I'd like that. It's been sitting a long time, and I figured somebody would've been out by now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T12:21:32-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I understand. Let me get a number for you. What's the best one?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T12:21:38-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0172."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T12:21:39-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four oh one, five five five, oh one seven two. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T12:21:45-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T12:21:47-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. So I've got a clogged catch basin with leaves, on the corner by 396 Admiral Kalbfus Road, standing water since before the holidays, dry weather, traffic backing up through it. And you want to know the last time it was cleaned."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T12:22:05-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep, that's all of it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T12:22:08-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll put it in as a request for a crew to clear it, and flag your question about the last visit. Do you know if the water is spreading toward the house, or is it staying in the road?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T12:22:25-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Stays in the road. For now. But with ice coming, it's going to freeze over like that and be worse."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T12:22:34-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good point, I'll note that too."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T12:22:37-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'd appreciate it. We've got Sunday dinner at her place, it's a family thing, always has been. She's already started cooking. People are going to be driving in from all over and they'll come right through that puddle."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T12:22:53-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, so Sunday would be the day you'd really like it cleared."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T12:22:59-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "If it could be, yeah. I know it's the holiday week."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T12:23:04-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is, and crews are stretched this week, so I can't promise a day. But I'll mark it so they see the timing. Somebody should call you back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T12:23:16-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Well, I'll wait to hear."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T12:23:19-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks for calling, Mr. Furtado. Have a good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T12:23:24-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks. You too."
    }
  ],
